{
  "sourceLanguage": "ja",
  "strings": {
    "${connection} に接続": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Connect to ${connection}"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@": {
      "shouldTranslate": false
    },
    "%@\n%@": {
      "shouldTranslate": false
    },
    "%@ · %@": {
      "shouldTranslate": false
    },
    "%@ からコピーしました": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Copied from %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ から画像をコピーしました": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Copied the image from %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ が起動しませんでした（2 分待ちました）。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ did not wake up (waited 2 minutes)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ にサインイン": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sign In to %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ に画像を貼り付けました": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pasted the image into %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ に自動で停止します": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Stops automatically at %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ に貼り付けました": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pasted to %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ のコピー": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Copy of %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ は接続先として読めませんでした。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ could not be read as a connection."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ を切断しますか？": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Disconnect %@?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ を外部ディスプレイに表示中": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ is on the external display"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ 承認しても安全にはならないため、接続は中止されます。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ Accepting it wouldn't make the connection safe, so it will be cancelled."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@（可変）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ (adjustable)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld 個のファイルを %@ に貼り付けました": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pasted %lld files into %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld 個のファイルをファイル App の「mRemote › 受信」に保存しました": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Saved %lld files to “mRemote › Received” in the Files app"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld%%": {
      "shouldTranslate": false
    },
    "(読み取れません)": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "(unreadable)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    ".rdp ファイルから読み込む": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Import .rdp File"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "100%": {
      "shouldTranslate": false
    },
    "App 切り替えに使われます。Win+Tab はキーバーの Win を押してから Tab。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Switches apps. For Win+Tab, tap Win on the key bar, then Tab."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple Pencil をペンとして送る": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Send Apple Pencil as a Pen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Caps キー": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Caps Key"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Connect with ${applicationName}": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Connect with ${applicationName}"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dynamic Island や画面の角の下にもデスクトップを表示します。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The desktop also shows under the Dynamic Island and the screen's corners."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dynamic Island、画面の角、ホームインジケータを避けて表示します。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The desktop stays clear of the Dynamic Island, the screen's corners and the Home indicator."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "FreeRDP 3.31.1 同梱": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bundled with FreeRDP 3.31.1"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "GC": {
      "shouldTranslate": false
    },
    "Globe（地球儀）キー": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Globe key"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "H.264 で画面を受け取る": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Receive the Screen as H.264"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "HTTPS（つながらなければ RPC）でゲートウェイを経由します。ゲートウェイの証明書も、接続先と同じように確認します。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Connects through the gateway over HTTPS, or RPC if that fails. The gateway's certificate is checked the same way as the computer's."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MAC アドレスは 16 進 12 桁で入力してください。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Enter the MAC address as 12 hexadecimal digits."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MAC アドレス（例 AA:BB:CC:DD:EE:FF）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "MAC Address (e.g. AA:BB:CC:DD:EE:FF)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mac とリモートのクリップボードは自動で同期します（テキストと画像）。ファイルはここから送受信します": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The Mac and remote clipboards stay in sync automatically (text and images). Send and receive files here."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "NLA 必須": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "NLA Required"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "OK": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "OK"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "RD ゲートウェイ": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "RD Gateway"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "RD ゲートウェイを使う": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Use an RD Gateway"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SHA-256 フィンガープリント": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "SHA-256 Fingerprint"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Spotlight に使われます。Win+Space はキーバーの Win を押してから Space。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Opens Spotlight. For Win+Space, tap Win on the key bar, then Space."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "TLS 必須": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "TLS Required"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "UIKit": {
      "shouldTranslate": false
    },
    "US": {
      "shouldTranslate": false
    },
    "Wake-on-LAN": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wake-on-LAN"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Windows の「設定 > 時刻と言語 > 言語と地域」で日本語の「言語のオプション」を開き、Microsoft IME の「キーボード オプション > キーとタッチのカスタマイズ」で「キーの割り当て」をオンにし、無変換キーを「IME-オフ」、変換キーを「IME-オン」にします。サインインし直すと効きます。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In Windows Settings > Time & language > Language & region, open Language options for Japanese. Under Microsoft IME > Keyboard options > Key and touch customization, turn on key assignment and set the Muhenkan key to IME-Off and the Henkan key to IME-On. It takes effect after you sign in again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Windows の拡大率": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Windows Scale"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "challenge.computer": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Computer"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "接続先"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iOS のキーボードの上のキーバーと、フル PC キーボードの上の列に、この順で並びます。1 回のタップで修飾キーごと送ります。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "They appear in this order on the key bar above the iOS keyboard and in the row above the PC keyboard. One tap sends the key with its modifiers."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iOS のサーバー証明書要件を満たしていません": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "It doesn't meet iOS's requirements for server certificates"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iPad の Command キーは Windows キーとして送るため、Windows キーを含むショートカットの一部が届きません。キーバーの修飾キーは 1 回押すと次の 1 キーだけ、2 回押すと固定、3 回目で解除です。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The iPad's Command key is sent as the Windows key, so some Windows-key shortcuts never reach the app. A modifier on the key bar applies to the next key after one tap, stays on after two, and turns off on the third."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iPadOS が先に使うキー": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Keys iPadOS Keeps"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iPadOS の「ハードウェアキーボード」設定で Caps Lock による入力切替がオンだと、英字入力の切替に使われます。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If switching input sources with Caps Lock is on in iPadOS's Hardware Keyboard settings, Caps Lock switches to and from the Latin input source."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iPadOS のショートカットに使われ、Windows へは送りません。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Used for iPadOS shortcuts and not sent to Windows."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iPadOS の入力切替に設定されていると届きません。キーバーの Ctrl を押してから Space。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Doesn't arrive if iPadOS uses it to switch input sources. Tap Ctrl on the key bar, then Space."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "profile-editor.section.computer": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Computer"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "接続先"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "↑": {
      "shouldTranslate": false
    },
    "↓": {
      "shouldTranslate": false
    },
    "⚠︎ %@ は古い RDP セキュリティで接続しています": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "⚠︎ %@ is connected with legacy RDP security"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "お気に入り": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Favorites"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "お気に入りから外す": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Remove from Favorites"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "お気に入りに追加": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Add to Favorites"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "かな": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kana"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "このアカウントはリモート接続を許可されていません。リモート側で「リモートデスクトップ ユーザー」に加えるか、管理者に確認してください。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This account isn't allowed to sign in remotely. Add it to Remote Desktop Users on the remote computer, or ask its administrator."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "このアプリのフォルダ": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This App's Folder"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "このサーバーは接続中の解像度変更に対応していません。接続先の設定で指定すると、次の接続から反映されます。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This server can't change resolution during a session. Set it in the connection's settings to use it from the next connection."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "このセッションを切断": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Disconnect This Session"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "このテキストは送れません（大きすぎるか NUL を含みます）。長いテキストは分けて送ってください": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This text can't be sent (too large or contains NUL). Send long text in parts"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "このデバイスに保存": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Save on This Device"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "この接続では音声が無効です（接続設定で変更できます）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Audio is off for this computer (change it in the computer's settings)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "この接続は古い RDP セキュリティで通信しています。暗号は弱く、サーバーの確認もできません。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This connection uses legacy RDP security. The encryption is weak and the server can't be verified."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "この接続先だけ、TLS/NLA を使えないサーバーへ古い RDP セキュリティで接続できるようにします。暗号は弱く、サーバーが本物かどうかの確認もできません。信頼できるネットワーク上の、自分が管理するマシンにだけ使ってください。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lets this computer only be reached with legacy RDP security when the server can't use TLS/NLA. The encryption is weak and the server's identity can't be checked. Use it only for machines you manage on a network you trust."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "この接続先で常に信頼": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Always Trust for This Computer"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "この接続先には以前に承認した証明書があり、今回はそれと異なる証明書が提示されました。サーバーの証明書を更新した場合にも起こりますが、通信が傍受されている場合にも同じことが起こります。心当たりがなければ承認せず、サーバー側で証明書を確認してください。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You accepted a different certificate for this computer before. This happens when the server's certificate is renewed, but it also happens when the connection is being intercepted. If you don't know why it changed, don't accept it; check the certificate on the server."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "この画面と同じ（ミラーリング）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Same as This Screen (Mirroring)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "この画面を左、モニターを右にした 2 画面のデスクトップです。ポインターはトラックパッドやマウスで画面をまたいで動かせます。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "One desktop over two screens: this screen on the left, the monitor on the right. Move the pointer across them with a trackpad or mouse."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "この端末で再生": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Play on This Device"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "この設定には対応していないため使いません: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Not supported, so not used: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "この証明書は承認できません。接続を中止してください。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This certificate can't be accepted. Cancel the connection."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "しない": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Off"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "しばらくすると OS が接続を閉じることがあります。戻ったときに切断されていたら「再接続」を押してください。RDP の切断はサインアウトではないので、同じデスクトップに戻ります。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "After a while the system may close the connection. If it's disconnected when you come back, tap Reconnect. Disconnecting RDP doesn't sign you out, so you return to the same desktop."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "する": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "On"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "その他": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Others"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "なぞるとポインターが動きます。タップでクリック、2 本指タップで右クリック、2 本指でスクロール。タップしてすぐもう一度触れて動かすか、押さえてから動かすとドラッグ。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Slide to move the pointer. Tap to click, tap with two fingers to right-click, and use two fingers to scroll. To drag, tap and then touch again and move, or touch and hold, then move."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ほとんど見えなくする": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nearly Hide"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "よく使うもの": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Common Shortcuts"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ろ": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ro"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "アクションなし": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No Action"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "アプリ内部のエラーです。もう一度接続してください。続く場合は、この詳細を添えて報告してください。（%@）": {
      "localizations": {
