            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Works as a Trackpad"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "トラックパッドのクリックボタン": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Trackpad Click Buttons"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ドメイン（任意）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Domain (optional)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ドライブ名": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Drive Name"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ネットワークに到達できません。iPhone/iPad のネットワーク接続と、VPN が必要な接続先ならその接続を確認してください。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The network can't be reached. Check this device's network connection, and the VPN if the computer needs one."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "バックグラウンドに移ったとき": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In the Background"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "バックスペース": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Backspace"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "パスワード": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Password"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "パスワードは Keychain にのみ保存され、接続設定のファイルやログには残りません。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The password is stored only in the Keychain, never in the settings file or logs."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "パスワードは Keychain にのみ保存され、接続設定ファイルには書き込まれません。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The password is stored only in the Keychain and never written to the settings file."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "パスワードを保存できませんでした（%@）。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The password couldn't be saved (%@)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ファイル App の「このiPhone内 › mRemote」が、Windows のエクスプローラーにドライブとして見えます。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\"On My iPhone › mRemote\" in the Files app appears as a drive in Windows File Explorer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ファイルまたはリンクの内容を入れました。確認して保存してください。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Filled in from the file or link. Check it, then save."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ファイルを貼り付けで送る…": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Send Files by Pasting…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "フォルダの共有": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Folder Sharing"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "フォルダを選ぶ…": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Choose a Folder…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "フォーカス喪失": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Focus lost"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "フローティング": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Floating"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "プログラム（例 ||notepad）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Program (e.g. ||notepad)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ヘルプ": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Help"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ホストIME": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Host IME"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ホスト名が見つかりません。ホスト名のつづりを確認するか、IP アドレスで指定してください。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The host name can't be found. Check its spelling, or use the IP address instead."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ホスト名または IP": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Host name or IP"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ホスト名を検証できていません": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The host name couldn't be verified"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ホーム画面に使われます。Win+H はキーバーの Win を押してから H。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Goes to the Home Screen. For Win+H, tap Win on the key bar, then H."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ポート": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Port"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "マイクは Windows 側のアプリが使うときだけ録音します。H.264 は動きの多い画面で通信量が減ります（端末のハードウェアで復号します）。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The microphone records only while an app on the Windows side uses it. H.264 uses less data for screens with a lot of motion (decoded by the device's hardware)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "マイクを使う": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Use Microphone"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "マイクを使用中（%lld kHz）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Microphone in Use (%lld kHz)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "メモリなどが足りず接続を始められませんでした。ほかのセッションを閉じてからもう一度試してください。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
